{"text": "Naan naalaikku varuven nu type pannu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu meeting ku late aagum", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, inniku office leave.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ezhudhu dear sir kindly grant me leave for two days", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Idha type pannu, bill amount aayiram rupees.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, njan nale varum.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ingane ezhuthu ente peru Suresh aanu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type cheyyu, report innu vaikunneram ayakkam.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type cheyyu thank you for your support", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu, shopping list paal mutta ari.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Inga type pannu en address Anna Nagar Chennai.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu happy birthday nu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu vanakkam ellarukkum", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Box la type pannu Coimbatore.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Search box il type cheyyu Kochi.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, ellavarkkum onam ashamsakal.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Taip pannu naan veetla irukken.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudu romba nandri sir.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "inge ezhuthu kuttikalkku school avadhi aanu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, payment mudinjidhu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, project deadline Friday.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type cheyyu ente phone number thazhe kodukkunnu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Idhu ezhudhu, rendu kilo thakkali vangu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane type cheyyu, sukhamano.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu ithu, class naale rendu manikku.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu Pongal vazhthukkal", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Dictate pannu, naan bus la irukken.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, dear team, please find the attachment.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu ten thirty ku meeting.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ingane ezhuthu nammal vijayichu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezuthu, vellam kudikkan marakkaruthu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, saappadu ready.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu en password maranthutten.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type cheyyu good morning", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, vandi kedayi, late aakum.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Indha line ah type pannu, thirukkural padikkanum.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, Madurai Meenakshi kovil.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu full stop.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ezhuthu Thiruvananthapuram", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type panna, naalai vidumurai.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, amma ku udambu sari illa.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, ningalude sahayathinu nanni.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type cheyyu, njan office il ethi.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu order number 4521", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, rent anju thousand.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu indha varthai, sandhosham.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhudu, train ettu manikku.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu kalyanam June pathinanju.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type cheyyu vishu ashamsakal", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, marunthu kaalaila saapidu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Comment la type pannu super video.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, paisa account il ittu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu question mark.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ezhudhu naan kandippa varen", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Taip cheyyu, ente veedu Thrissur aanu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, subject leave application.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, yours sincerely Karthik.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, mazha kaaranam school illa.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu ippo vandhutten.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu meeting cancel aachu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu, ithu valare nalla idea aanu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, room number nooru irupathu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu new line.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type cheyyu, onnum prashnam illa.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, enakku oru doubt irukku.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhudhu, gas cylinder book cheythu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, invoice attach panniten.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type pannu congratulations", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu, aduthu aazhcha kaanam.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Note la ezhudhu, current bill kattanum.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu Deepavali nalvazhthukkal.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezhuthu, njan sugamayi irikkunnu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, salem to chennai ticket.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type cheyyu, ok sheri.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Tipe pannu naan konjam busy.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, inniku vela mudinjidhu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ingane ezhuthu parcel kitti", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, comma, appuram.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu ithu, Kerala bhangiyulla naadu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, PIN code six double zero zero four zero.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, sorry thappu aayiduchu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane type cheyyu, nale kanam.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudu nalla mazhai peiyudhu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, total moonu nooru.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ingane ezuthu, ammaykku sukhamilla.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu naan Tirunelveli la porandhen.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "type cheyyu meeting postpone cheythu", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, ok parkalam.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhuthu, ningal evide aanu.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "இதை டைப் பண்ணு, நான் வீட்டுக்கு வந்துட்டேன்.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "எழுது நாளை விடுமுறை", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "டைப் பண்ணு இனிய புத்தாண்டு வாழ்த்துக்கள்", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "எழுது, கூட்டம் பத்து மணிக்கு.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "இங்கே டைப் பண்ணு என் பெயர் லக்ஷ்மி", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "எழுது, மிக்க நன்றி ஐயா.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "டைப் பண்ணு பால் வாங்கணும்", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "இങ്ങനെ എഴുതൂ, ഞാൻ നാളെ വരും.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ടൈപ്പ് ചെയ്യൂ സുപ്രഭാതം", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "എഴുതൂ, ഓണാശംസകൾ.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ഇങ്ങനെ ടൈപ്പ് ചെയ്യൂ, എന്റെ വീട് കോട്ടയം ആണ്", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "എഴുതൂ ഇന്ന് ക്ലാസ് ഇല്ല", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ടൈപ്പ് ചെയ്യൂ, വളരെ നന്ദി.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "இதை எழுது, வேலை முடிஞ்சது.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "ഇങ്ങനെ എഴുതൂ, മീറ്റിംഗ് മാറ്റി വച്ചു", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "டைப் பண்ணு, ரூம் நம்பர் இருநூறு.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "എഴുതൂ, ബിൽ അടച്ചു.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "எழுது பொங்கல் வாழ்த்துக்கள்", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Ezhudhu, naan kovilukku poren.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type cheyyu, train vaiki.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
{"text": "Type pannu, delivery address mathanum.", "action": "type_text", "app": null, "group": "r2_type_text_dravidian"}
